		(property "Description" "Smallsized module supporting 2.4 GHz WiFi (802.11 b/g/n) and Bluetooth ® 5 (LE) Built around ESP32S3 series of SoCs, Xtensa ® dualcore 32bit LX7 microprocessor Flash up to 8 MB, optional 2 MB PSRAM in chip package 39 GPIOs, rich set of peripherals Onboard PCB antenna or external antenna connector"
